            "F: Well, if you like the place, it's yours as soon as I get a contract drawn up with the solicitor.",
            "F: The first month's rent and a deposit are mandatory on signing the contract.",
            "F: Then we can work out when is the best day for you to pay rent each month.",
            "M: We'll be incredibly happy to be your new tenants.",
            "M: Thank you so much.",
            "M: My wife will be thrilled to get out of the shabby place we are now in and start filling those wardrobes with all those shoes."
