            "F: It seems so simple, just transporting cargo from point A to point B, driving from one city to another.",
            "F: But I really appreciate all the details that go into the game.",
            "F: It's even given me a new appreciation for the logistics industry and traffic on the road.",
            "M: I completely agree.",
            "M: My brother also introduced me to some videos of someone that streams their game online.",
            "M: It was fascinating to watch, really.",
            "M: This guy drove very carefully, obeyed all the road signs and traffic rules.",
            "M: Such a contrast to most violent games.",
            "F: Honestly, playing has inspired me to look into the industry more.",
            "F: I've read articles about how self-driving trucks may soon be available and could greatly impact cargo logistics.",
            "F: Considering all that goes into driving these larger vehicles, it's amazing that we could soon have that kind of technology.",
