          "transcript": [
            "Conversation 1.",
            "M: Tonight we have a special guest from a local establishment, the Parisian Café.",
            "M: Welcome.",
            "F: Hi, thanks for having me on your show.",
            "M: Thank you for joining us.",
            "M: So please tell us, why did you decide to open a café?",
            "F: Well, we saw the opportunity to offer something a little special and different from other establishments.",
            "F: Cafés certainly are a very competitive market sector.",
            "F: There are more than plenty in our city and we felt they are all rather similar to each other.",
            "F: Wouldn't you agree?",
            "M: Certainly, yes.",
            "M: So how is your establishment any different?",
            "F: Well, simply put, we have rabbits wandering freely around the place.",
            "F: Our customers come in and enjoy their food and drinks, while little rabbits play about and brush against their legs.",
            "F: There's no other place like it.",
            "M: That's amazing.",
            "M: How did you come up with the idea?",
            "F: We saw other cafés with cats in them, so we thought, why not rabbits?",
            "F: People love rabbits.",
            "F: They are very cute animals.",
            "M: But is it safe?",
            "M: Do the rabbits ever bite people or do any customers ever hurt the rabbits?",
            "F: It's perfectly safe for both the rabbits and our customers.",
            "F: Rabbits are very peaceful and certainly do not bite.",
            "F: Furthermore, our rabbits are regularly cleaned and have all received the required shots, so there is no health risk whatsoever.",
            "F: As for our customers, they are all animal lovers, so they would never try to hurt the rabbits.",
            "F: Sometimes a young child may get over-excited and be a little too rough, but it's never a serious matter.",
            "F: On the contrary, the Parisian café offers a great experience for children, a chance for them to learn about rabbits and how to take care of them.",
            "M: Well, it's certainly the first time I've heard of a café like that."
          ],
